\p
\v 9 \w Mine heart| strong="H3820" \w* \w within| strong="H7130" \w* [me is broken]{strong=“H7665” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”} \w because of the prophets| strong="H5030" \w*; \w all my bones| strong="H6106" \w* [shake]{strong=“H7363” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}; \w I am like a drunken| strong="H7910" \w* \w man| strong="H376" \w*, \w and like a man| strong="H1397" \w* \w whom wine| strong="H3196" \w* [hath overcome]{strong=“H5674” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, \w because| strong="H6440" \w* of the \sc Lord\sc*, \w and because of the words| strong="H1697" \w* \w of his holiness| strong="H6944" \w*. 
\v 10 \w For the land| strong="H776" \w* [is full]{strong=“H4390” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [of adulterers]{strong=“H5003” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8764”}; \w for because| strong="H6440" \w* \w of swearing| strong="H423" \w* \w the land| strong="H776" \w* [mourneth]{strong=“H56” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}; \w the pleasant places| strong="H4999" \w* \w of the wilderness| strong="H4057" \w* [are dried up]{strong=“H3001” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, \w and their course| strong="H4794" \w* \w is evil| strong="H7451" \w*, \w and their force| strong="H1369" \w* is not right.\f + \fr 23:10 \ft swearing: or, cursing \f* \f + \fr 23:10 \ft course: or, violence \f* 
