\c 34
\p 
\v 1 \w The word| strong="H1697" \w* \w which came unto Jeremiah| strong="H3414" \w* from the \sc Lord\sc*, \w when Nebuchadnezzar| strong="H5019" \w* \w king| strong="H4428" \w* \w of Babylon| strong="H894" \w*, \w and all his army| strong="H2428" \w*, \w and all the kingdoms| strong="H4467" \w* \w of the earth| strong="H776" \w* [of his dominion]{strong=“H4475 H3027”}, \w and all the people| strong="H5971" \w*, [fought]{strong=“H3898” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8737”} \w against Jerusalem| strong="H3389" \w*, \w and against all the cities| strong="H5892" \w* [thereof, saying]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”},\f + \fr 34:1 \ft of his…: Heb. the dominion of his hand \f* 
