\v 4 [Yet hear]{strong=“H8085” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w the word| strong="H1697" \w* of the \sc Lord\sc*, \w O Zedekiah| strong="H6667" \w* \w king| strong="H4428" \w* \w of Judah| strong="H3063" \w*; [Thus saith]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} the \sc Lord\sc* [of thee, Thou shalt not die]{strong=“H4191” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w by the sword| strong="H2719" \w*: 
