\v 14 [Then said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w Jeremiah| strong="H3414" \w*, It is \w false| strong="H8267" \w*; [I fall not away]{strong=“H5307” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w to the Chaldeans| strong="H3778" \w*. [But he hearkened]{strong=“H8085” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [not to him: so Irijah]{strong=“H3376”} [took]{strong=“H8610” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w Jeremiah| strong="H3414" \w*, [and brought]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w him to the princes| strong="H8269" \w*.\f + \fr 37:14 \ft false: Heb. falsehood, or, a lie \f* 
