\v 40 \w As God| strong="H430" \w* \w overthrew| strong="H4114" \w* \w Sodom| strong="H5467" \w* \w and Gomorrah| strong="H6017" \w* \w and the neighbour| strong="H7934" \w* cities [thereof, saith]{strong=“H5002” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”} the \sc Lord\sc*; so \w shall no man| strong="H376" \w* [abide]{strong=“H3427” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [there, neither shall any son]{strong=“H1121”} \w of man| strong="H120" \w* [dwell]{strong=“H1481” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} therein. 
