\v 43 \w The king| strong="H4428" \w* \w of Babylon| strong="H894" \w* [hath heard]{strong=“H8085” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w the report| strong="H8088" \w* [of them, and his hands]{strong=“H3027”} [waxed feeble]{strong=“H7503” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}: \w anguish| strong="H6869" \w* [took hold]{strong=“H2388” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} of him, and \w pangs| strong="H2427" \w* [as of a woman in travail]{strong=“H3205” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}. 
